From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:40:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Point light shadows: the light list's shadowed lights in its
 state set

The light manager hands each object's light list to the support library, which adds the
shadow code (A3_PS_ON, the shadowed lights' slots) only for objects a shadowed light reaches.
---
 components/sceneutil/lightmanager.cpp | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/components/sceneutil/lightmanager.cpp b/components/sceneutil/lightmanager.cpp
index 986de7abf3..c95f279c88 100644
--- a/components/sceneutil/lightmanager.cpp
+++ b/components/sceneutil/lightmanager.cpp
@@ -560,6 +560,8 @@ namespace SceneUtil
 
         stateset->addUniform(data);
         stateset->addUniform(new osg::Uniform("PointLightCount", static_cast<int>(lightList.size())));
+        // Alpha3: the point light shadows' shader code, for the objects a shadowed light reaches
+        Alpha3::pointShadowListState(viewMatrix, found->first.second, *stateset);
 
         found->second = stateset;
         return stateset;
